    <group name="func_physics_dynamic" color="0.5 0.5 0.5">
dynamic object that is affected by physics

<string key="classname" name="Classname" value="func_physics_dynamic">The classname of the entity.</string><string key="targetname" name="Name">Logical name of this entity. Used by other entities to target it.</string><angle key="angle" name="Yaw Angle" value="0">Yaw rotation in degrees. 0 = East, 90 = South, etc.</angle><angles key="angles" name="Pitch Yaw Roll" value="0 0 0">Full rotation: Pitch Yaw Roll in degrees.</angles><integer key="spawnflags" name="Spawnflags" value="0">Bitmask of spawning flags.</integer><flag key="no_dificuly_easy" name="Don't spawn on Easy" bit="0" /><flag key="no_dificuly_normal" name="Don't spawn on Normal" bit="1" /><flag key="no_dificuly_hard" name="Don't spawn on Hard" bit="2" /></group>
    <group name="snd_reverb_zone" color="0.5 0.5 0.5">
Plays fmod snapshop when entering. Can override each other.
<string key="snapshot" name="Snapshot Path" value="snapshot:/Reverb/Cave Reverb">path to snapshot</string><integer key="priority" name="Priority" value="1">0 for world default</integer><string key="classname" name="Classname" value="snd_reverb_zone">The classname of the entity.</string></group>
